1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,660
I was driving alone.

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,340
But my truck weighed one hundred
and forty-one pounds too much.

3
00:00:06,860 --> 00:00:08,620
Three scales in three towns.

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:10,350
The same number.

5
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:11,220
To the pound.

6
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:14,090
And all of it was sitting
on the front axle.

7
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:16,600
Right under the passenger seat.

8
00:00:17,180 --> 00:00:19,140
That seat had sunk all the way down.

9
00:00:20,050 --> 00:00:21,670
Like somebody had just sat in it.

10
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:25,190
Then an old scale ticket
fell from behind my visor.

11
00:00:26,060 --> 00:00:27,250
Two weights in pencil.

12
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:27,890
With June.

13
00:00:27,900 --> 00:00:28,800
Without June.

14
00:00:29,390 --> 00:00:32,420
The difference was one
hundred and forty-one pounds…

15
00:00:32,920 --> 00:00:34,810
The full story is on my channel.
